{"unit_id":"2877905731__dsh-think-autoexpand#caveat-1","repo":"2877905731/dsh-think-autoexpand","commit":"877665c137325111bb84c304847687dd43ee56bf","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-think-autoexpand 使用前须知：宿主端注入规则要求始终用中文思考和回复，并非随界面语言切换；README 对此描述不一致。（见 index.js:14-25、README.md:3）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:14-25","README.md:3"]}
{"unit_id":"2877905731__dsh-think-autoexpand#readme-1","repo":"2877905731/dsh-think-autoexpand","commit":"877665c137325111bb84c304847687dd43ee56bf","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-think-autoexpand README · dsh-think-autoexpand：DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端插件：让执行过程中的 Think 思考行始终可见并自动展开，并让 Agent 的思考语言跟随 Harness 界面语言。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-think-autoexpand"}
{"unit_id":"2877905731__dsh-think-autoexpand#readme-2","repo":"2877905731/dsh-think-autoexpand","commit":"877665c137325111bb84c304847687dd43ee56bf","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-think-autoexpand README · 功能：- 强制显示被 dsh-auto-collapse 等折叠插件隐藏的 `[data-variant=\"think\"]` 思考行\n- 思考行进入 `running`（流式输出中）状态时自动展开，完整思考过程实时可见\n- 不干扰工具卡的折叠效果（保留 dsh-auto-collapse 对工具卡的行为）\n- 每个回合注入中文语言规则（通过官方 agent/pre-step 机制）：始终强制中文思考（Think / reasoning）与回复\n  - 规则本身用中文书写，避免自指矛盾\n  - 兼容 minimal 等使用 complete persona 的预设（普通 system prompt 会被该预设丢弃）","source":"extracted","section":"功能"}
{"unit_id":"2877905731__dsh-think-autoexpand#readme-3","repo":"2877905731/dsh-think-autoexpand","commit":"877665c137325111bb84c304847687dd43ee56bf","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-think-autoexpand README · 安装：```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web-desktop add github:2877905731/dsh-think-autoexpand\n```\n\n安装后重启 dsh Web 服务生效。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
